{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/475490/extras/f2efac3d5a76eeed7421debc1ed64e99.avif?t=1754873221\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Power to Manipulate Reality</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Struggle Between Two Worlds and Their Plagued Co-Existence</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Political Battle On The Verge Of Revolution</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mysterious String Of Murders, Claiming Family and Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At The Heart of It All -- Is You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A wave of murder and suicide has been hitting the country, all under circumstances more than mysterious. You play as one of the &quot;Lucky Two&quot;, winners of a contest who have the honor of touring with an international pop idol. But as you arrive in Tokyo for the launch of this world tour, events quickly escalate. You have no choice but to delve deeper into dangerous territory -- all in the name of uncovering the truth of these enigmatic deaths. A truth that involves the dissonant connection to another world; and the inhabitants within who seek salvation. You are The Savior -- and it is your job to deliver a brighter future to this world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Length Of Several Novels </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>30 Characters to Interact With</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Forge Friendships With An In-Depth Affection System </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>SMS System: Send and Receive Text Messages To/From Characters </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Many Choices Leading to Different Experiences</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Multiple Endings</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Steam Trading Cards </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Controller Support</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Steam Achievements</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Steam Link and Steam Overlay Support</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/475490/88346b4b5cae07ecbe1ebf3128d40e9c28cdac2c.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to The Ark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/475490/596758d8417b4b1e43031c50da1fc6ff4551527b.jpg"},{"name":"A Case of Vertigo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/475490/e41cb21fd70fd06ae1255d7fe0d6f49695ddb569.jpg"},{"name":"Rook Takes Pawn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/475490/5bfe3e8c44072c20e0aa63dff07cdf0e01745b34.jpg"},{"name":"Jaded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/475490/467bcb0297e71b62cd6585723e3ee7a004f53b23.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to Cafe Chat!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/475490/532afb13e29a2e0402147095876c3f09fc8c7634.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to Arcadia!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/475490/467bcb0297e71b62cd6585723e3ee7a004f53b23.jpg"},{"name":"That Something Special","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/475490/532afb13e29a2e0402147095876c3f09fc8c7634.jpg"},{"name":"At The Apex","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/475490/467bcb0297e71b62cd6585723e3ee7a004f53b23.jpg"},{"name":"A Sudden Outburst","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/475490/e41cb21fd70fd06ae1255d7fe0d6f49695ddb569.jpg"}],"total":136},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/475490?t=1754873221","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/475490?t=1754873221","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/475490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754873221","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/475490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754873221","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist The Upcoming Re(Vision)!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/475490/extras/f2efac3d5a76eeed7421debc1ed64e99.avif?t=1754873221\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Power to Manipulate Reality</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Struggle Between Two Worlds and Their Plagued Co-Existence</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Political Battle On The Verge Of Revolution</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mysterious String Of Murders, Claiming Family and Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At The Heart of It All -- Is You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A wave of murder and suicide has been hitting the country, all under circumstances more than mysterious. You play as one of the &quot;Lucky Two&quot;, winners of a contest who have the honor of touring with an international pop idol. But as you arrive in Tokyo for the launch of this world tour, events quickly escalate. You have no choice but to delve deeper into dangerous territory -- all in the name of uncovering the truth of these enigmatic deaths. A truth that involves the dissonant connection to another world; and the inhabitants within who seek salvation. You are The Savior -- and it is your job to deliver a brighter future to this world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Length Of Several Novels </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>30 Characters to Interact With</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Forge Friendships With An In-Depth Affection System </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>SMS System: Send and Receive Text Messages To/From Characters </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Many Choices Leading to Different Experiences</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Multiple Endings</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Steam Trading Cards </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Controller Support</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Steam Achievements</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Steam Link and Steam Overlay Support</i></p>","developers":["Klace"],"dlc":[1686040],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/475490/header.jpg?t=1754873221","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/475490/65521/3d19a3729e74218c53ba14502de1aa07f0ec7136/1751290908/dash_av1.mpd?t=1469042430","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/475490/65521/3d19a3729e74218c53ba14502de1aa07f0ec7136/1751290908/dash_h264.mpd?t=1469042430","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr